  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A multi-use, dual-ended brush to apply, blend, and set targeted areas of the eyes and face.<br><br><b>Brush Formulation: </b>All formulas<br><br><b>Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><br><b>Handle Length:</b> 2.55 inches<br><br><b>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This brush features a soft, flat brush head for targeted application of cream formulas and shadows. The fluffy hairs on the other end are perfect for blending, setting, and diffusing. All Makeup By Mario brushes are made with a custom blend of synthetic and vegan fibers and 100% FSC-certified birchwood handles.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b><br>-Use the flat side to apply concealer or primer on targeted areas of the eyes and face.<br>-Flip it over and use the fluffy end of the brush to set, blend, and diffuse. <br>-Use the flat end to create a cut crease, and also to shape the eyebrows.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A multi-use, dual-ended brush to apply, blend, and set targeted areas of the eyes and face.<br><br><b>Brush Formulation: </b>All formulas<br><br><b>Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><br><b>Handle Length:</b> 2.55 inches<br><br><b>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This brush features a soft, flat brush head for targeted application of cream formulas and shadows. The fluffy hairs on the other end are perfect for blending, setting, and diffusing. All Makeup By Mario brushes are made with a custom blend of synthetic and vegan fibers and 100% FSC-certified birchwood handles.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b><br>-Use the flat side to apply concealer or primer on targeted areas of the eyes and face.<br>-Flip it over and use the fluffy end of the brush to set, blend, and diffuse. <br>-Use the flat end to create a cut crease, and also to shape the eyebrows.</div></details>",
